# GitHub auto-requests review from the listed owner whenever a PR touches
# matching files. The "*" pattern matches everything, so identity is
# review-requested on every PR.
#
# The team must have at least write access to this repo, otherwise the entry
# is ignored. By default the request goes to the whole team; if the team's
# code review assignment is enabled, GitHub instead auto-assigns a subset of
# members. Keep it disabled to request the full team:
# https://github.com/orgs/camunda/teams/identity/settings
*  @camunda/identity
